1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,830
We are 628 Aerospace,
and this is Flare AI.

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:08,780
NASA's microgravity combustion research: 24 investigations
and 537 experimental trials, consolidated into one resource.

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:12,400
Investigations are ranked by their relevance to spacecraft,
lunar habitats and Martian outposts.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,410
Comparisons are drawn only between commensurable data;
incompatible requests are declined, with reasons given.

5
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:20,560
Every value is traceable to its NASA source,
and all 537 records were verified by hand.

6
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:24,270
Our SI responds exclusively from NASA's records
and acknowledges when the evidence is insufficient.

7
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:28,290
For lunar and Martian missions, identifying what remains
untested may prove decisive for crew safety.
